  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "M\u1ED9t \u0111i kh\xF4ng tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i, ki\xEAn tr\xEC v\u1EDBi
      \u0111\u1EA1o t\xE2m, \u0111\u1EEBng quay \u0111\u1EA7u,  h\xE3y ng\u1EA9ng
