      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt, t\xECm ra l\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng
      c\u1EE7a ri\xEAng b\u1EA1n!"
    textEN: Once you step forth, there is no turning back. Remain steadfast in your
      purpose, do not look behind. Hold your head high, let the light guide the path
      before you, and find the ideal that is yours alone.
